About WPP Production

We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP's content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today's always on, AI driven marketing world.

About WPP

WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&nbsp;in a single company -&nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&nbsp; WPP.com .

We believe the best work happens when we're together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That's why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process. &nbsp;

What does Creative Technologist do at WPP Production?

A Creative Technologist at WPP Production is positioned at the crossroads of creativity and technology. Their primary role is to harness cutting-edge technological advancements to enhance and actualise creative visions. In collaboration with the Marketing Transformation Team, as well as with designers, developers, and other stakeholders, they ensure that tech-driven solutions are utilized to amplify the essence of creative content and effectively address client requirements. Essentially, a Creative Technologist integrates innovative technological tools and methods with artistic concepts, ensuring that the end product is both technologically advanced and creatively compelling within the framework of WPP Production's commitment to delivering superior content experiences. This role has a strong focus on AI. &nbsp;

Key Responsibilities &nbsp;

• Collaborate with interdisciplinary teams to ideate, design, and developvisually stunning projects using a mix of AI, 3D, and retouching techniques. &nbsp;

• Harness the power of AI image generation tools to create innovative visualsfor various campaigns and products. &nbsp;

• Design, model, and render 3D assets that can be integrated with AI-generated imagery or used independently. &nbsp;

• Expertly retouch and enhance photos, ensuring they meet the highest quality standards for both print and digital platforms. &nbsp;

• Stay abreast of the latest advancements in AI image generation, 3D design, and retouching techniques to ensure cutting-edge output. &nbsp;

• Provide guidance and mentorship to junior team members, fostering a culture of continuous learning and innovation. &nbsp;

• Troubleshoot technical issues related to visual projects and provide solutions. &nbsp;

• Stable Diffusion - highly desirable &nbsp;

Requirements &nbsp;

• AI Image Generation: Experience with AI-based image generation tools and platforms, with an understanding of underlying algorithms. &nbsp;

• 3D Expertise: Proficiency in industry-leading 3D software like Blender, Maya,or Cinema 4D. &nbsp;

• Retouching Skills: Mastery in retouching using software such as AdobePhotoshop, with a keen eye for detail. &nbsp;

• Innovation: A knack for conceptualizing and executing visually compelling solutions by combining AI, 3D, and retouching techniques. &nbsp;

• Collaboration: Excellent interpersonal skills and the ability to work seamlessly with designers, developers, and other stakeholders. &nbsp;

• Continuous Learning: Commitment to staying updated with the ever-evolving fields of AI, 3D &nbsp;

• Stable Diffusion - highly desirable &nbsp;

